~ start
if QuestStates.has_flag("gave_battery_to_nathan"):
	=> gotBattery

Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]] Do you have a battery?
if PlayerInventory.has_item("battery")
	Nathan: niiceee you do!
	$> PlayerInventory.remove_item("battery")
	$> QuestStates.set_flag("gave_battery_to_nathan", true)
else:
	Nathan: come back when you have a battery!
=> END


~ gotBattery
Nathan: Thanks for the Battery again!